### Get all users

GET {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get user by id

GET {{host}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get user by id (failed - 404)

GET {{host}}/api/users/123
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### invite a user

POST {{host}}/api/users/invite
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "darius",
  "email": "dariusszocs11@gmail.com",
  "phone": "0747474747",
  "role": "PARTICIPANT"
}

### Create user

POST {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ionel",
  "email": "ionel@gmail.com",
  "password": "!IonelCelSmecher123",
  "phone": "0747474747",
  "role": "PARTICIPANT"
}

