### Update user

PUT {{host}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ionelionel",
  "email": "ionel@gmail.com",
  "password": "!IonelCelSmecher123",
  "phone": "+40712121212",
  "role": "PARTICIPANT"
}

